= Flashing =
The build process creates a folder called '''flasher''' in the Debug folder. 
To flash the device via the TI Uniflash, simply execute the '''flash.bat'''.
Currently the path to the Uniflash program is hardcoded to <br>
<code>C:\ti\uniflashv3\ccs_base\scripting\examples\uniflash\cmdLine\uniflash</code>

